# Goal-Driven Execution

Every task needs a verifiable success criterion before code.

- Vague → specific: "add validation" becomes "reject missing/invalid email with 400 naming the field; tests for both cases".
- Multi-step work: state the plan first (schema, model, endpoint, validation, tests, regression run) so the user can stop a bad approach early.

Do not dive in and figure it out as you go.
